{title: Kadhi Tu}
{artist: Hrishikesh Ranade Mumbai Pune Mumbai}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
kadhi [D]tuuu [A]uuu,        [Em]rimzim zar [A]nari bars [D]aat
kadhi [D]tuuu [A]uuu,        [Em]chamcham kar [A]nari chand [D]nyaat
kadhi [Bm]tu [A]uuuuu [D]uuu,        [Bm]koslatya dhara [G]thaiman vaara
[D]bijlichi na [G]kshi [A]ambara [D]t,        [Bm]salsaltya laata [G]bhijlelya vata,
[D]chimb [G]pavsachi [D]ooli [Em]raat,        kadhi [D]tuuu [A]uuu,
[Em]rimzim zar [A]nari barsaa [D]t....        kadhi [D]tuuuu [G]uuu,
[A]ang-ang [G]moharnari,        [A]aasmant [G]darvalnari,
[D]raat-rani ve [A]dya jangalaa [D]t,        kadhi [Bm]tuuuuuu [Em]uuu
[A]hirvya chafya [D]chya paklyat...
